                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْفَى عَلَيْهِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He looked upon it, looked upon
it from above, looked down upon it; got a view
of it;</i> or <i>saw it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْرَفَ عَلَيْهِ</span>, (S, Msb, K,
TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِطَّلَعَ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوفى فِيهِ</span> [likewise] signifies
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشرف</span>. (TA.) ― 
